#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "What actually changed ?"
msgstr "到底发生了什么变化？"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The number of different guides and documentation materials grew over the years,\n"
"to the point where it became harder to find information unless you knew what\n"
"you were looking for, or relied solely on the search functionality."
msgstr "多年来，各类指南和文档材料的数量不断增加，以至于除非你知道自己要找什么，或者完全依赖搜索功能，否则很难找到所需信息。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To address this, we have decided to reorganise the guides by categories rather\n"
"than keeping them grouped by types (guide, tutorial, etc.). In addition, we wanted\n"
"to make it easier to navigate between the guides once you have already opened a\n"
"specific page."
msgstr "为了解决这个问题，我们决定按类别对指南进行重新整理，而不是继续按类型（指南、教程等）进行分组。此外，我们还希望让您在打开特定页面后，能够更方便地在各指南之间进行导航。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Curated category groups of guides"
msgstr "精心挑选的指南分类组"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Grouping the guides by type simply stopped working with the number of different\n"
"guides that we have now. Hence, we have decided to reorganise them into category\n"
"groups by the topic they belong to. We have kept the already familiar icons for\n"
"the guide types so that it's also clear what to expect from a particular document."
msgstr "鉴于目前指南种类繁多，按类型分组的方法已无法正常运作。因此，我们决定根据指南所属的主题，将其重新划分为各类组别。我们保留了大家已经熟悉的指南类型图标，以便用户能清楚地了解特定文档的内容。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Having a small, concise group with a clear topic helps narrow down to the guide you are\n"
"looking for. Some categories are also divided into subcategories for a more fine-grained\n"
"grouping. But as the number of groups grows, how do you discover what categories are\n"
"available? That is why we have also introduced a navigation menu on the left that helps\n"
"you jump from one category to another."
msgstr "拥有一个主题明确、规模小而精炼的分类组，有助于您快速锁定所需的指南。 部分分类还进一步细分为子分类，以便进行更精细的归类。但随着群组数量的增加，您该如何了解有哪些分类可供选择呢？正因如此，我们在左侧新增了一个导航菜单，方便您在不同分类之间快速切换。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is a curated set of categories, and within each category, guides are placed in a\n"
"specific order: more relevant/fundamental guides to the category go first, followed by\n"
"more specialised guides."
msgstr "这是一组经过精心筛选的分类，每个分类中的指南都按特定顺序排列：与该分类相关性更高或更基础的指南排在前面，随后是更专业的指南。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We have decided to have a dedicated pinned section where we include the guides that may\n"
"or may not be in other categories, but which we find to be useful or often visited."
msgstr "我们决定设立一个专门的置顶版块，将那些可能属于其他分类、也可能不属于其他分类，但我们认为有用或访问量较大的指南收录其中。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We have also slightly changed the guide cards style and behaviour -- now they will open\n"
"in the same tab rather than a new one. You can still open them in a new tab as any other\n"
"page -- just `Ctrl`/`cmd`+`click` as you would any other link."
msgstr "我们还对指南卡片的样式和行为进行了微调——现在它们会在当前标签页中打开，而不是在新标签页中打开。您仍然可以像打开其他页面一样在新标签页中打开它们——只需像点击其他链接一样 `按住 Ctrl/Cmd 键并点击即可` 。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Updated search behaviour"
msgstr "更新的搜索行为"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After some discussions and considerations, we landed on preserving the category groups\n"
"in the search results representation. Our concern was whether we would lose the search\n"
"relevance if we preserve the categories when displaying search results. We addressed\n"
"this by reordering the category groups based on your search. The more relevant guides\n"
"to your query a category contains, the closer to the top of the category list it is."
msgstr "经过一番讨论和权衡，我们最终决定在搜索结果的展示中保留分类组。 我们曾担心，如果在显示搜索结果时保留分类，是否会降低搜索的相关性。为解决这一问题，我们根据您的搜索内容重新排序了分类组。某个分类中与您的查询越相关的指南越多，该分类在列表中的位置就越靠前。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We have also decided to remove the highlighted content snippets from the results screen.\n"
"While our intuition, when the feature was initially delivered, was that these could help\n"
"decide whether a particular guide contains the information you are looking for, it turned\n"
"out that we would need to show much more content to provide enough context to make that\n"
"decision. Doing so clutters an already information-heavy page even further."
msgstr "我们还决定从结果页面中移除那些突出显示的内容片段。虽然在该功能最初推出时，我们的直觉是这些片段有助于判断某篇指南是否包含您正在寻找的信息，但事实证明，为了提供足够的上下文以便做出这一判断，我们需要显示更多内容。 这样做会进一步增加本就信息量庞大的页面的杂乱感。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We've preserved the other search capabilities. In particular, we kept the search suggestions,\n"
"which try to find something close to what you were trying to look up but may have made a\n"
"typo."
msgstr "我们保留了其他搜索功能。特别是，我们保留了搜索建议功能，该功能会尝试找到与您想要查找的内容相近、但可能因输入错误而出现偏差的结果。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "And as a reminder, it is a full text search, not just a keyword search!"
msgstr "顺便提醒一下，这是全文搜索，而不仅仅是关键词搜索！"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Actual guide page"
msgstr "实际指南页面"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The biggest change to a guide page is also the one easiest to miss -- we have\n"
"added a full categorised list of guides that you can pull out from the left\n"
"slide-out panel -- just click on that grey bar."
msgstr "指南页面最大的变化也是最容易被忽略的一点——我们新增了一份完整的分类指南列表，您可以通过左侧的滑出式面板调出该列表——只需点击那条灰色横条即可。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This allows you to navigate between the guides without going back to the all\n"
"guides page. It also makes it easier to explore guides from the same categories\n"
"that the current guide belongs to -- those are expanded by default when you\n"
"pull out the panel."
msgstr "这样，您无需返回“所有指南”页面，即可在各指南之间切换。此外，这还便于您浏览与当前指南属于同一类别的指南——当您拉出面板时，这些指南默认处于展开状态。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We have also slightly modified the table of contents, and it now shows the\n"
"list of top-level sections. When you scroll through the guide the section\n"
"you are currently reading will be highlighted and if it has any subsections,\n"
"it will expand and a corresponding subsection title will be highlighted.\n"
"This helps you see where you are currently at, especially with those longer\n"
"guides."
msgstr "我们还对目录进行了微调，现在它显示的是顶级章节列表。当您在指南中滚动浏览时，当前正在阅读的章节会高亮显示；如果该章节下有子章节，则会展开，并高亮显示相应的子章节标题。这有助于您了解当前所在的位置，尤其是在阅读较长的指南时。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Navigation examples"
msgstr "导航示例"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We are sure that you will find your own way around the guides and have a flow\n"
"that works best for you. But we did want to share a few practical examples of\n"
"how we ourselves navigate through the pages."
msgstr "我们相信，您一定能找到适合自己的方式来浏览这些指南，并摸索出一套最适合您的操作流程。不过，我们还是想分享几个实际案例，说明我们自己是如何浏览这些页面的。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sometimes you just need to find a configuration property key and either your\n"
"IDE does not give you a suggestion, or you do not have a Dev UI running to look\n"
"it up there -- well, look no further -- the list of all configuration properties\n"
"is pinned right there at the top of the guides page:"
msgstr "有时你只需要查找一个配置属性键，但要么你的 IDE 没有提供建议，要么你没有运行 Dev UI 无法在那里查询——别再费心找了——所有配置属性的列表就固定在指南页面的顶部："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you know exactly what you are looking for, let's say you need to look up some\n"
"Hibernate ORM extension specifics, you can just click on the `Data` category or\n"
"even more specific on the `ORM and Hibernate` and pick the flavour of Hibernate\n"
"ORM you prefer, be it a regular Jakarta Persistence, Reactive, or something more\n"
"high level as Hibernate ORM with Panache -- they all are under that category."
msgstr "如果你已经确切知道自己要找什么——比如需要查阅一些 Hibernate ORM 扩展的具体信息——只需点击 `“数据”` 类别，或者更具体地选择 `“ORM”和“Hibernate` ”，然后挑选你偏好的 Hibernate ORM 实现方式，无论是常规的 Jakarta Persistence、 Reactive，还是像 Hibernate ORM with Panache 这样更高级的实现——它们都归在该类别之下。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once on the Hibernate ORM guide page you may realise that you need to check how\n"
"to configure the datasources or maybe tune the Hibernate Validator for validating\n"
"the entities -- there is no need to go back to the all guides page. Just open the\n"
"list of all categorised guides hidden on the left-side pullout panel:"
msgstr "进入 Hibernate ORM 指南页面后，您可能会发现需要查看如何配置数据源，或者需要调整 Hibernate Validator 来验证实体——此时无需返回“所有指南”页面。只需打开隐藏在左侧拉出面板中的所有分类指南列表即可："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you aren't quite certain what category/guide may contain the information you need,\n"
"or if maybe you are looking for something that might be in the Quarkiverse --\n"
"search is your best friend in this case. Just start typing what you are looking for:"
msgstr "如果您不太确定哪个分类/指南可能包含您需要的信息，或者您正在寻找可能位于 Quarkiverse 中的内容——在这种情况下，搜索功能将是您的得力助手。只需输入您要查找的内容即可："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As search results preserve the category groups, you can easily jump from one to another\n"
"by clicking through the categories you see on the left."
msgstr "由于搜索结果保留了分类组，您可以通过点击左侧显示的分类，轻松地在各个分类组之间切换。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "What is next ?"
msgstr "下一步是什么？"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The release of these improvements also coincided with the migration of the site\n"
"from Jekyll to Roq (a Quarkus-powered static site generator). We would like to\n"
"address a few remaining migration concerns first, but we are also discussing\n"
"ideas as possible improvements to ease the documentation discovery, lookup, and\n"
"navigation to related content."
msgstr "这些改进的发布恰逢网站从 Jekyll 迁移至 Roq（一款基于 Quarkus 的静态网站生成器）。我们希望先解决几个剩余的迁移问题，但同时也正在探讨一些改进方案，以方便用户查找、检索文档以及浏览相关内容。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "反馈"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We would like to hear back from you and your experience navigating the Quarkus guides.\n"
"What does work for you, what would you like to see us improve ?"
msgstr "我们希望听到您的反馈，了解您在使用 Quarkus 指南时的体验。哪些内容对您有帮助？您希望我们改进哪些方面？"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
