msgstr "我们非常重视您的反馈，如果您发现任何问题——请 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkusio.github.io/issues[告诉我们] ！"

#, fuzzy
msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "无论您是 Quarkus 用户，还是单纯出于好奇，都请不要害羞，欢迎加入我们这个热情友好的社区："

#, fuzzy
